<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bidvest ups interest payable on debentures.</title>
<headline>Bidvest ups interest payable on debentures.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bidvest Group Ltd said on Friday interest payable on its compulsorily convertible debentures of 180 cents each had been increased to approximately 20 percent.</p>
<p>It said the compulsory conversion of the debentures had been extended to the last Friday in September 2000 from the last Friday in September 1998.</p>
<p>Bidvest had also been given an additional right to convert the debentures on the last Friday in March each year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
